  // Reverts the splits and clears the inline styles of every
  // mobile-only element (optionally scoped to a root), then parks
  // any unit that has nothing left to animate. Called immediately
  // when the breakpoint flips upward, and by the about script
  // before it splits the paragraphs it shares with this system.
